From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slopfire <hgrmeanwhile@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] feat(acp): surface a bundled Oh My Pi registry entry

Refresh the ACP registry implementation and tests against the current v2
orchestrator source, including its required toolsDir test configuration.

diff --git a/apps/server/src/provider/acp/AcpRegistrySupport.test.ts b/apps/server/src/provider/acp/AcpRegistrySupport.test.ts
index c276dcd83..27e24bb21 100644
--- a/apps/server/src/provider/acp/AcpRegistrySupport.test.ts
